IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `scarta-parenthood`

-- Status of Children (Assisted Reproduction Technology) Act 2013, ss 3, 4, 5-11 and 15 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_status-of-children-assisted-reproduction-technology-act-2013.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

